<title>POLAND: GRAJEWO APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 2.0 MLN.</title>
<headline>GRAJEWO APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 2.0 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.03 vs   1.95</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.12 vs   2.20</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.99 vs   2.56</p>
<p> Sales		   23.59 vs  16.44</p>
<p> JANUARY-APRIL	  1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     8.28 vs   7.50</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	12.68 vs  12.22</p>
<p> Operating profit    12.70 vs  13.46</p>
<p> Sales		   91.35 vs  77.85</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish wood panel producer is Zaklady</p>
<p>Plyt Wiorowych Grajewo SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
